Provenance note: this dataset is a derived, anonymized release of the
private working database used in the above study. Building names,
addresses, postal codes, coordinates, and source file paths that could
identify specific real buildings have been removed or replaced with
generic identifiers; see data/anonymize_database.py for the exact
transformation applied. All quantitative and categorical fields (floor
areas, material intensities, structural/MEP parameters, computed material
stock results, validation results) are unchanged from the values reported
in the study.
